// Speakty's version for macOS and Linux, the only one we maintain. scripts/release.sh bumps it.
// macos/Config/Signing.xcconfig includes it, and linux/build.rs reads MARKETING_VERSION from it.
// CFBundleVersion equals the version, so every release is identified by it alone.
MARKETING_VERSION = 0.2.3
CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION = $(MARKETING_VERSION)
